# Goal
# Commands:
#   "detection" - Detect elevator and return position/angle
#   "in"        - Detect elevator and drive into it
#   "out"       - Drive out of elevator (reverse of entry)
#   "execute"   - Execute direct movement to specified x, y, yaw
string command

# Target position for "execute" command (ignored for other commands)
float64 target_x      # Target X position (meters)
float64 target_y      # Target Y position (meters)
float64 target_yaw    # Target yaw angle (radians)

---

# Result
bool success
string message

# Detection result (only valid when command is "detection")
float64 center_x
float64 center_y
float64 width
float64 depth
float64 yaw_deg
float64 confidence

---

# Feedback
string status
float64 progress
